cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite Whether's scores, conditions or historical record, please cite it as below."
title: "Whether: weekly operating guidance from interest-rate and credit conditions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jain
    given-names: Kanav
license: MIT
url: "https://whether.work"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zz-plant/whether"
abstract: >-
  Whether scores U.S. funding pressure and risk appetite from public market data
  (Treasury yields, the yield curve, volatility and financial conditions) every
  Monday, places the week in one of four conditions, and sets an action, a pause
  line and a resume line for hiring, spending, fundraising and other operating
  decisions. Conditions are scored at every month-end since 2012 by the same
  engine the live brief runs.
keywords:
  - macroeconomics
  - interest rates
  - yield curve
  - startups
  - operating decisions
  - model context protocol
